OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 17 JAN
OL,4,G0800FRadcliffe and Maconie
OL,5,     GMark and Stuart present a feast
OL,6,     Gof great music, plus Khruangbin's
OL,7,     GLaura Lee shares her 'First, Last
OL,8,     Gand Everything'.
OL,9,G1000FDeb Grant
OL,10,     GDeb has a melting pot of glorious
OL,11,     Gmusic to ease you into Saturday.
OL,12,     GExpect Fugazi, De La Soul, Can,
OL,13,     GBeastie Boys and loads more. Live
OL,14,     Gfrom the Salford Riviera.
OL,15,G1300FJamz Supernova
OL,16,     GJamz is joined by Olukemi Lijadu
OL,17,     Gto explore Feedback, a new
OL,18,     Gaudiovisual project connecting
OL,19,     GWest African rhythm, house music,
OL,20,     Gand diasporic memory.
