OL,4,G1500FGilles Peterson
OL,5,     GGilles digs deep in his record
OL,6,     Gcollections to unearth hidden
OL,7,     Gmusical gems. Plus, he speaks
OL,8,     Gwith legendary American jazz
OL,9,     Gsaxophonist Gary Bartz about his
OL,10,     Glifelong musical journey.
OL,11,G1800FThe Craig Charles Funk and Soul
OL,12,     FShow
OL,13,     GThis week's Trunk of Funk comes
OL,14,     Gfrom Michelle David & The True-
OL,15,     Gtones, delivering a 30-minute mix
OL,16,     Grooted in gospel soul, deep
OL,17,     Ggrooves and pure feel-good energy.
